# NOTE:
# This git repository is rooted at Desktop, but we only want to version-control
# the Omega project under `nobel/Omega-Protein-Folding/`.
# Everything else on Desktop is ignored to avoid accidentally committing
# personal files (pdf/pptx/etc.) and large binaries.

# Ignore everything by default
/*

# Keep this file
!.gitignore

# Allow the nobel folder to be visible
!nobel/

# Ignore all other content inside nobel by default
nobel/*

# Track ONLY Omega-Protein-Folding
!nobel/Omega-Protein-Folding/
!nobel/Omega-Protein-Folding/**

